---
// 번역 홈 — /en/ · /zh/. 게시된 번역이 하나도 없는 언어는 만들지 않는다(src/lib/posts.ts)
import { TRANSLATED_LANGS } from '../../i18n';
import { getPosts } from '../../lib/posts';
import HomeView from '../../views/HomeView.astro';

export async function getStaticPaths() {
	const paths = [];
	for (const lang of TRANSLATED_LANGS) if ((await getPosts(lang)).length > 0) paths.push({ params: { lang } });
	return paths;
}
const { lang } = Astro.params as { lang: 'en' | 'zh' };
---

<HomeView lang={lang} />
